{"id":"427621","name":"萝卜樱水泡菜","author":"朝族媳妇辣白菜","authorId":"10218894","desc":"","cover":"images/427621/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"萝卜樱","amount":"500g"},{"name":"黄瓜","amount":"1根"},{"name":"红辣椒","amount":"2个"},{"name":"绿辣椒","amount":"2个"},{"name":"大葱","amount":"1段"}],"sub":[{"name":"大粒盐","amount":"6勺"},{"name":"蒜末","amount":"3勺"},{"name":"姜末","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"鱼露","amount":"2勺"},{"name":"熟水","amount":"2碗"},{"name":"辣椒面","amount":"3勺"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"萝卜樱洗净切段。","img":"images/427621/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"放入大粒盐。","img":"images/427621/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"腌制30分钟。","img":"images/427621/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"黄瓜切4分段。","img":"images/427621/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"红绿辣椒和小葱切圈。","img":"images/427621/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"蒜、姜切末。","img":"images/427621/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"糯米糊倒入姜末，蒜末，辣椒面，鱼露。","img":"images/427621/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"搅拌均匀。","img":"images/427621/step_8.gif"},{"step":9,"desc":"萝卜樱挤干水份。","img":"images/427621/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放入黄瓜、葱花。红辣椒。","img":"images/427621/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"倒入酱料搅拌均匀。","img":"images/427621/step_11.gif"},{"step":12,"desc":"腌制6小时后倒入熟水。","img":"images/427621/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"萝卜樱水泡菜做好啦。","img":"images/427621/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"1.萝卜樱一定要选择新鲜的！\n2.腌制过程中，要用盐把萝卜樱中的水份腌出！\n3.冰箱冷藏保管，腌制发酵后才会更好吃！\n \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}